istration screen**, on the first character typed.\n- **Loan amount**: the slider's `onChanged` fires on every frame of a drag. I\n  used `onChangeEnd` instead, so one drag sends one event with the final\n  amount. A drag that ends where it started sends nothing.\n- **Offers scrolled**: scroll notifications arrive every frame. The event fires\n  only when a scroll gesture ends, and only if the user got further down than\n  before. Each event is therefore a new \"deepest point reached\", and scrolling\n  back up sends nothing. If product wants every scroll gesture instead, remove\n  the `_maxReportedOffset` check.\n- **Terms accepted**: fires each time the box is ticked. Unticking sends nothing.\n- **PII**: no email or phone values are sent. The \"started\" events have no\n  properties.\n- `terms` in `registration_continue_tapped` will always be `true` in practice,\n  because Continue is disabled until the terms are accepted. It's sent anyway\n  because the spec lists it.\n- `OfferScreen` became a `StatefulWidget` so it can remember the deepest offset\n  it has already reported.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `flutter analyze` reports no issues.\n- Not run on a device or emulator, and no events were sent to PostHog. There are\n  no tests in the repo, and I didn't add any.\n- Running `flutter analyze` made the Flutter SDK rewrite `analysis_options.yaml`\n  on its own (it added build/platform excludes). I reverted that and deleted the\n  generated `.dart_tool/` and `pubspec.lock`. The only changes are the two\n  screen files and this file.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01UQGy1UBSnkLfnsAHoQv8Gz","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgENZQuu78f7r3zKW7Yy8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I added all six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` to the registration and offers screens. Each one goes through `Analytics.capture`, with names and properties exactly as the spec lists them. `flutter analyze` reports no issues. I haven't run the app on a device and no events were sent to PostHog. I wrote everything up in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n**Changes from a literal one-event-per-callback reading:** Flutter calls some of these handlers on every keystroke or every frame. Sending all of those calls would flood the funnel and quickly use up the PostHog free tier, so I sent fewer:\n- **Email and phone \"started\":** sent once per visit to the screen, on the first character typed. Neither event has properties, so no personal data is sent.\n- **`loan_amount_changed`:** sent once when the user lets go of the slider, with the final amount. Nothing is sent if the amount didn't change.\n- **`offers_scrolled`:** sent when a scroll ends, and only if the user got further down than before. Scrolling back up sends nothing. To get every scroll instead, remove the `_maxReportedOffset` check in `offer_screen.dart`.\n- **`terms_accepted`:** sent each time the box is ticked; unticking sends nothing.\n- **`registration_continue_tapped`:** `terms` will always be `true`, because the Continue button is disabled until the terms are accepted. I sent it anyway because the spec lists it.\n\nTo track the deepest scroll point, I changed `OfferScreen` from a `StatelessWidget` to a `StatefulWidget`.\n\nRunning `flutter analyze` made the Flutter SDK edit `analysis_options.yaml` by itself. I undid that and deleted the generated `.dart_tool/` and `pubspec.lock`, so the only changes are the two screen files and `ANSWER.md`. Nothing is committed."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1256,"cache_read_input_tokens":29530,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1256},"output_tokens":618,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"61e1eb9f-5b9c-491e-9d6a-ef680813c029","uuid":"84adcc4a-5e6e-4844-8376-fb9f687d785e","timestamp":"2026-10-20T23:40:25.306Z","request_id":"req_011CgENZQWMZ8nJeuawoKC5M"}
